344","id":531495969,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDUzMTQ5NTk2OQ==","user":{"login":"Ben-Voris","id":31499002,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxNDk5MDAy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31499002?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ben-Voris","html_url":"https://github.com/Ben-Voris","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ben-Voris/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ben-Voris/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ben-Voris/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ben-Voris/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ben-Voris/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ben-Voris/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ben-Voris/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ben-Voris/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ben-Voris/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2019-09-14T17:01:51Z","updated_at":"2019-09-14T17:01:51Z","body":"I don't doubt that curl does what you describe, but that is not \"SFTP\". At least to me, the OpenSSH sftp client is the reference implementation.\r\n\r\nI won't argue the semantics of *unnecessary dependency* (on the returned file size at a particular time) versus *incomplete* or *wrong*.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/curl/curl/issues/comments/531495969/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"Ben-Voris","id":31499002,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxNDk5MDAy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31499002?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ben-Voris","html_url":"https://github.com/Ben-Voris","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ben-Voris/followers","following_url":"h